"Backup Folder" = "备份文件夹";
"Choose Backup Folder" = "选择备份文件夹";
"Choose Folder" = "选择文件夹";
"Choose Folder…" = "选择文件夹…";
"Back Up Now" = "立即备份";
"Verify Snapshot" = "验证快照";
"Verify Snapshot…" = "验证快照…";
"Verify" = "验证";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Working…" = "正在处理…";
"No backup folder selected." = "尚未选择备份文件夹。";
"Choose a folder on a local drive, external drive, or iCloud Drive. Only backup snapshots are copied there; the working database and audio stay on this Mac." = "选择本地磁盘、外置磁盘或 iCloud 云盘上的文件夹。只有备份快照会复制到该文件夹；工作数据库和音频仍保留在此 Mac 上。";
"Privacy and retention" = "隐私与保留";
"Completed local ASR versions are included; unfinished jobs and temporary inputs are excluded." = "备份包含已完成的本地 ASR 转录版本；不包含未完成的任务和临时输入。";
"Snapshots are not encrypted by this app. They include recordings, transcripts, speaker identities, and potentially biometric voiceprint vectors. Protect the destination and its sharing permissions. Model weights and pairing keys are not exported." = "本应用不会加密快照。快照包含录音、转录文本、说话人身份，并可能包含生物识别声纹向量。请保护备份位置并谨慎设置共享权限。模型权重和配对密钥不会导出。";
"Choosing iCloud Drive delegates upload to macOS. A locally completed backup does not mean it has uploaded to iCloud or is available on another device." = "选择 iCloud 云盘后，由 macOS 负责上传。本地备份完成并不代表已上传至 iCloud 或已可在其他设备上访问。";
"Historical snapshots retain deleted recordings, transcripts, and voiceprints until you remove those snapshots yourself. This app never automatically deletes old backups." = "历史快照会保留已删除的录音、转录和声纹，直至您自行移除这些快照。本应用不会自动删除旧备份。";
"Restore is unavailable. Verification is read-only and does not restore data or alter the working library." = "暂不支持恢复。验证仅以只读方式进行，不会恢复数据或修改工作资料库。";
"Backup folder selected. Your working library stays on this Mac." = "已选择备份文件夹。工作资料库仍保留在此 Mac 上。";
"Backup complete locally. Cloud upload status is managed by macOS, not verified by this app." = "本地备份已完成。云端上传状态由 macOS 管理，本应用未验证上传是否完成。";
"Cancelled. No completed snapshot was published." = "已取消。未发布任何完整快照。";
"Verification cancelled." = "已取消验证。";
"Folder selection cancelled." = "已取消选择文件夹。";
"Snapshot verified: checksums, audio references, and database integrity match. This does not verify cloud upload." = "快照验证通过：校验和、音频引用和数据库完整性均符合预期。这不代表已验证云端上传。";
"Unsafe backup path: %@" = "不安全的备份路径：%@";
"Missing, changed, or unverified audio: %@. No backup was published." = "音频缺失、已更改或尚未验证：%@。未发布备份。";
"Snapshot verification failed. Files, checksums, or database integrity do not match." = "快照验证失败。文件、校验和或数据库完整性不符合预期。";
"The backup folder is unavailable. Reconnect the drive or choose the folder again." = "备份文件夹不可用。请重新连接磁盘或再次选择文件夹。";
"A completed local transcript version is corrupt or changed during backup. No backup was published. Try again after processing finishes." = "已完成的本地转录版本已损坏或在备份期间发生更改。未发布备份。请在处理完成后重试。";
